# vdlgr Release Notes

## 0.0.2 (XX Oct 2024)

- bundled paddleocr models into "resources" folder, updated ocr to use these.
- updated interval slider to 0.1s increments and set min to 0.1s (max still 10s).
- interval slider value is now checked when OCR processing starts.
- layout updated to accomodate larger resolution videos and longer lists of boxes. 
- suggested output file now in .csv filetype, not .txt.

## 0.0.1 (10 Oct 2024)

* Initial release
